{"name":"Milkshake Pink","hex":"#f0cdd2","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"milkshake","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A thick beverage consisting of milk and ice cream mixed together, often with fruit, chocolate, or other flavoring.","A thin beverage, similar to the above, but with no ice cream or significantly less of it."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To administer an alkaline supplement to (a horse) to improve its racing performance.","To throw a milkshake at (a person)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/milkshake"},{"term":"pink","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A color reminiscent of pinks, the flowers.","Magenta, the colour evoked by red and blue light when combined."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having a colour between red and white; pale red.","Of a fox-hunter's jacket: scarlet."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/pink"}],"entries":[{"title":"Milkshake","blocks":[{"text":"A milkshake is a sweet beverage made by blending milk, ice cream, and flavorings or sweeteners such as butterscotch, caramel sauce, chocolate syrup, or fruit syrup into a thick, sweet, cold mixture. It may also be made using a base made from non-dairy products, including plant milks such as almond milk, coconut milk, or soy milk. Dry ingredients such as whole fruit, nuts, seeds, candy, or cookies are sometimes incorporated."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/Strawberry_milk_shake_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Strawberry_milk_shake_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Milkshake","wikidata":"Q37159"},{"title":"Pink","blocks":[{"text":"Pink is a pale tint of red or rose, the color of the pink flower. It was first used as a color name in the late 17th century. A combination of pink and white is associated with innocence, whereas a combination of pink and black links to eroticism and seduction."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Pink_sapphire_ring.jpg/330px-Pink_sapphire_ring.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pink","wikidata":"Q429220"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3b/Milkshakes_at_Mels_Diner.jpg/500px-Milkshakes_at_Mels_Diner.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3b/Milkshakes_at_Mels_Diner.jpg/500px-Milkshakes_at_Mels_Diner.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A strawberry and a chocolate shake, each topped with whipped cream, sprinkles, and a maraschino cherry","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMilkshakes_at_Mels_Diner.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Strawberry-Mint_Liquid_Nitrogen_Shake_at_HBurger_in_Denver.jpg/500px-Strawberry-Mint_Liquid_Nitrogen_Shake_at_HBurger_in_Denver.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Strawberry-Mint_Liquid_Nitrogen_Shake_at_HBurger_in_Denver.jpg/1280px-Strawberry-Mint_Liquid_Nitrogen_Shake_at_HBurger_in_Denver.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Strawberry-Mint_Liquid_Nitrogen_Shake_at_HBurger_in_Denver.jpg/500px-Strawberry-Mint_Liquid_Nitrogen_Shake_at_HBurger_in_Denver.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"This milkshake was made using liquid nitrogen. Vapor can still be seen forming at the top.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AStrawberry-Mint_Liquid_Nitrogen_Shake_at_HBurger_in_Denver.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/Chocolate_milkshake_..._%F0%9F%98%8B.jpg/500px-Chocolat